# Edge Function secrets. Copy to supabase/functions/.env (git-ignored);
# `supabase/deploy.sh secrets` sends every line to the project.

# PREVIEW_SALT: a random string of 32 or more characters, e.g. from
#   `openssl rand -hex 24`. invite-preview salts its per-address hit count with it.
PREVIEW_SALT=
# INVITE_ORIGIN: the origin of the site that serves invite_page/, with no
#   trailing slash, e.g. https://invites.example.org or https://<user>.github.io.
#   The browser may read invite previews only from this origin.
INVITE_ORIGIN=
